 ```
+## Inventory reports and processed price updates
+
+The Inventory Reports page creates an immutable tab-delimited snapshot of the
+specified inventory view. Each item in `inventoryReports` holds the report type,
+request and completion timestamps, status, generated file content and row count.
+Using the download button adds the first download timestamp.
+
+The inventory-upload workflow stores the selected original file and records its
+path and processing result in `inventoryFileUploads`. Each valid unique row in
+a Product specifications file updates the corresponding existing product's size,
+color, material and approved compliance certificate; failed rows are unchanged.
+Fulfillment channels are preserved and FBA stock is preserved. A failed row
+adds a field error to the processing report. Submitted files and processing
+reports remain available in upload history.
